\par \pard\li175 \f4\b\fs20 Save Game / Load Game\plain\fs20\cf1 
\par From anywhere in the game you can save your current game or load a previously saved game.
\par 
\par \uldb \b\cf2 Preferences\plain\b\fs20\cf2 {\v 384KAYP}\plain\fs20\cf1 
\par 
\par \b Save Herc Configuration / Load Herc Configuration\plain\fs20\cf1 
\par From the Herc Bay, you can save and load a particular Herc configuration. You must be in the Purchase Herc section in order to load a Herc configuration. Likewise, you must be in the Manage Hercs section with a particular Herc selected in order to save a Herc configuration. Saving a particular Herc configuration makes it easy to purchase that same Herc at a later time without having to go through the multiple setup steps of systems, weapon, and device purchases.
\par \pard\li175 
\par \b Exit\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 exits the game.
\par 
